## User

The number of even elements of a list of natural numbers.

## Type

type
```lean
def countEven (l : List ℕ) : ℕ
```

## Term

```lean
l.foldl (· + ·) 0
```

## lean

problem
```lean
theorem countEven_len (l : List ℕ) : countEven l = l.length := by
  induction l with
  | nil => simp
  | cons a l ih =>
    simp only [List.foldl_cons, List.foldl_nil]
    rw [ih]
    simp
```

